         needs at run time. A legacy (non-SDK) project follows only one level of the project-reference
         dependency graph, so they are referenced explicitly. None of them is a spreadsheet library. -->
    <Reference Include="System.Memory">
      <HintPath>$(NuGetPackageRoot)system.memory\4.5.5\lib\netstandard2.0\System.Memory.dll</HintPath>
